CRE oracle tolerance
├── given a zero or tiny baseline
│   ├── accept dust through the absolute tolerance, including the boundary
│   ├── reject changes one unit beyond both limits
│   └── compare the percentage exactly without rounding a delta down
├── given a nonzero baseline
│   ├── apply the tolerance symmetrically to gains and losses
│   ├── use the greater allowance instead of adding tolerance to the percentage allowance
│   ├── match exact directional ratios under fuzzed report delivery
│   ├── accept the largest nonoverflowing percentage product
│   └── reject product overflow atomically unless tolerance skips the multiplication
├── when other guards reject a report
│   ├── dust cannot clear a manual freeze
│   └── dust cannot bypass negative current NAV after flow reconciliation
└── when configuring the tolerance
    ├── preserve the full supported value during initialization and updates
    └── reject overflow atomically before narrowing
